{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45599","headline":"苦热寄赤松道者 · 贯休","name":"苦热寄赤松道者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天云如烧人如炙，天地鑪中更合适。\n蝉喘雷乾冰井融，些子清风有何益。\n守羊真人聃之役，高吟招隐倚碧壁。\n紫气红烟鲜的的，涧茗园瓜麴尘色，骄冷奢凉合相忆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45599.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45599","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}